  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n3x(3x - 8) + y(y + 1) + 4z2 - 2z + 16(1)/(2) = 0\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n3x(3x - 8) + y(y + 1) + 4z2 - 2z + 16(1)/(2) = 0\n\n⇒ 9x² - 24x + y² + y + 4z² - 2z + 161over2= 0\n\n⇒ 9x² - 24x + (4)² + y² + y + (1/2)² + 4z² - 2z + (1/2)² = 0\n\n⇒ (3x)² - 24x + (4)²] + [(y)² + y + (1/2)²] + [(2z)² - 2z + (1/2)²] = 0\n\n⇒ (3x - 4)² + (y + 1over2)² + (2z - 1over2)² = 0\n\n⇒ 3x - 4 = 0; y + 1over2 = 0; 2z - 1over2 = 0\n\n⇒ 3x = 4; y = -1/2; 2z = 1/2\n\n⇒ x = 4/3; y = - 1/2; z = 1/4\n\n6x + y + 2z = 6(4/3) + (-1/2) + 2 × (1/4)\n\n⇒ 8 - (1/2) + (1/2)\n\n⇒ 8\n\n**∴ The value of (6x + y + 2z) is 8.**",
